  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, whenever the bravo outwits a creature, critical hits made against them are automatically confirmed, and the weapons critical multiplier is increased by 1 on such an attack (×2 becomes ×3, and so on). This benefit lasts for the same number of rounds as his exploit uncertainty ability.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
